          "text": "Route matched: **ordinary-source-positive**. Named check passed.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Program** (`examples/agent-quickstart/pair.wasmc`) — smallest complete source:\n```wasmc\npackage local:logical_pair;\n\ninterface api {\n  run: func(value: s32, flag: bool) -> tuple<bool, bool> {\n    return tuple(value != 0, flag);\n  }\n}\n\nworld app { export api; }\n```\n\n**Command run:** `node examples/agent-quickstart/run-pair.mjs`\n\n**Exact result:**\n```json\n{\"accepted\":true,\"source\":\"examples/agent-quickstart/pair.wasmc\",\"core_bytes\":49,\"core_sha256\":\"55f3c7e3d09b564b89b8268299a69569a33b856b46405cb4c4dd51634afec84e\",\"imports\":[],\"exports\":[{\"name\":\"run\",\"kind\":\"function\"}],\"call\":\"run(5, true)\",\"result\":[1,1]}\n```\n\n- **Compiler:** pinned public `current/wasmc.mjs` (`compile` + `inspectWasm`)\n- **Core bytes:** `49`\n- **core_sha256:** `55f3c7e3d09b564b89b8268299a69569a33b856b46405cb4c4dd51634afec84e`\n- **Imports inspected:** `[]` (pure; instantiated with `{}` against the application-owned allowlist)\n- **Exports:** `[{\"name\":\"run\",\"kind\":\"function\"}]`\n- **One call executed:** `run(5, true)` → `[1, 1]`\n\nSignature: accepts `s32` + `bool`, returns `tuple<bool, bool>` — both logical values as **one semantic result** (`value != 0` and the echoed `flag`).\n\n**Embedding warning:** the tuple is one semantic result; JavaScript observes two flattened Core lanes, not an automatically lifted object.\n\nStopping here per the matched route."
